Mickey, Grey, I want you to stop him with your Apollon robots.

01:03:47.320 --> 01:03:49.940
In the meantime, I'll take care of the key energy.

01:03:50.750 --> 01:03:52.560
What? But Terry...

01:03:52.560 --> 01:03:56.320
Do as I say. It's important that I follow my mother's instructions.

01:03:57.920 --> 01:04:00.000
Alright, I'll stall the Avenger as long as I can.

01:04:01.120 --> 01:04:02.280
We'll do our best, Harry.

01:04:05.100 --> 01:04:06.440
You can!

01:04:42.280 --> 01:04:45.100
For this to work, I must remove the key energy from my chest.

01:04:45.640 --> 01:04:47.250
But Master Diapollen.

01:04:50.610 --> 01:04:54.390
Hurry. I know in my heart that this is the right thing to do.

01:04:55.870 --> 01:05:00.000
I know now that restoring peace is more important.

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:10.850
You are wise, Diapolan. I shall help you for the sake of eternal peace in the universe with no regrets. I know how important peace is now.

01:05:10.850 --> 01:05:28.100
This is a delicate operation. The key energy will be removed without cutting the skin.

01:06:34.220 --> 01:06:34.740
What is it?

01:06:35.910 --> 01:06:36.910
Die, Apollon!

01:06:37.700 --> 01:06:42.080
As guardian droid, I am to give you the last Apollon energy.

01:06:53.080 --> 01:06:55.160
It was your father's last wish.

01:06:55.680 --> 01:07:00.000
I was programmed to give you this, to restore eternal peace.

01:07:03.960 --> 01:07:04.420
Ugh.

01:08:14.300 --> 01:08:14.820
A wonderful robot!

01:09:27.770 --> 01:09:29.030
- Energy heart first.

01:09:42.480 --> 01:09:45.560
As long as I've got the Queen, I can't lose.

01:09:45.560 --> 01:09:53.280
I'll never surrender your doing.

01:09:53.280 --> 01:09:56.640
I think you know as well as I do.

01:09:56.640 --> 01:10:00.000
You must stop this senseless war at once, do you understand?

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:14.260
I understand!

01:10:14.260 --> 01:10:16.260
Now what are you doing? Have you gone mad?

01:10:16.260 --> 01:10:26.360
It was over for us.

01:10:26.360 --> 01:10:28.000
Dirty double-crosser.

01:10:35.020 --> 01:10:42.650
Energy! Hi!

01:11:37.870 --> 01:11:40.660
Leave it. The shadow has disappeared.

01:11:42.070 --> 01:11:43.880
Done what we could not.

01:11:44.390 --> 01:11:46.370
Our planet will thrive again.

01:11:46.700 --> 01:11:47.800
Thanks to dying.

01:11:48.470 --> 01:11:48.910
Apollo.

01:12:06.010 --> 01:12:06.530
Ah!

01:12:58.960 --> 01:13:00.000
grown up well

01:13:00.090 --> 01:13:04.100
And I abomin, restored peace to the galaxy.
